This file will be loaded by PCM when the production scenario is selected; it should load TES-common-ais's config/production/ActiveTasks_Common.rb.rb.  It will launch the following tasks by default:

### A6N2 - SystemTasks
   ProductionLogger

### A6N2 - AuxiliaryProcesses
   AllProcessMonitor, SysLogBridgeAggregator, MachSerialNumTask

### OCS - SystemTasks
   MachineOCS, LogSnapshotBridge